<<if !$CompletedQuests.includes("Shinju: Monster Boy")>>
    <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry…”</span> He scratches his cheek nervously, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“After everything that happened with  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ryker</span> and finally telling my mom about it, she signed me up for some self-defense classes, just to be safe. It’s all swimming around in my head and I just moved without thinking… sorry…”</span> You tell him it’s fine, it only hurt a little, but maybe he should think a little before flipping someone onto the ground. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah, fair enough.”</span> He says with an embarrassed smile. <br>

    <<socialChange "Lucas" 1>>
    <<addMoodlet "Pained" 3>>
